:pnlgrp.
:help name='ORDENT'.
Process Customer Order (ORDENT) - Help
:p.The Process Customer Order (ORDENT) command calculates order tax using
service program TAXSRV, inserts a new order into SQL table ORDHDR, and
updates customer balance in physical file CUSTPF.
:ehelp.
:help name='ORDENT/CUSTID'.
Customer ID (CUSTID) - Help
:xh3.Customer ID (CUSTID)
:p.Specifies the 8-digit customer identifier in CUSTPF.
:ehelp.
:help name='ORDENT/AMOUNT'.
Order Subtotal Amount (AMOUNT) - Help
:xh3.Order Subtotal Amount (AMOUNT)
:p.Specifies the pre-tax order amount in dollars and cents.
:ehelp.
:epnlgrp.
